    "detailed_description": "<strong>Cat Tree</strong> is a relaxing and captivating indie game where you can collect adorable cats that inhabit a mysterious tree. Starting with just a few cats, you'll watch as your tree grows, revealing new sections with fresh spots for your charming pets.<br>Discover a variety of cats hiding in each container!<br>You'll find everything from common to the most unique ones. Collect them all to expand your collection.<br>Your task is to nurture the cats, watch them grow, and decide which ones to keep in your collection and which to sell for profit. Explore the tree and uncover all its secrets while enjoying the peaceful and soothing atmosphere of the game.",
